{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-19","kind":"proposition","title":"三角形中大角对大边","englishTitle":"In any triangle the greater angle is subtended by the greater side.","book":1,"number":19,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.19","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.19/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":19,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","contentId":"euclid-1-19","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b008822cde0a9d7e670ed939017644c865ed28390bc6071da8fed58c44c835a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-19.statement","euclid-1-19.construction.1","euclid-1-19.proof.1","euclid-1-19.proof.2","euclid-1-19.proof.3","euclid-1-19.proof.4","euclid-1-19.proof.5","euclid-1-19.proof.6","euclid-1-19.conclusion","euclid-1-19.historical.1","euclid-1-19.historical.2","euclid-1-19.historical.3","euclid-1-19.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-19.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d52f11d500cf6be71fa4218eedd9c1b80718275ac3a35a242836109b6103709","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In any triangle the greater angle is subtended by the greater side."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在任何三角形中,较大的数量角度由较大的数量角度进行辅助。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形大角对大边小角对小边"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每当三角形的大角对应大边，小角对应小边时"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"084cde1ca9021438544e3c453133e50ff985edea364dbb98b87c414986135ec9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be a triangle having the angle ABC greater than the angle BCA;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC变成三角形,其角度大于ABC, 大于角度BCA;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"451d6c722f51eee0052eb20fefbc938d7f07428b6b1d6a936a203afc074459c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the side AC is also greater than the side AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说AC的侧面也比AB的侧面大"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b1066fd948bf3a96adff8def6af70b2f99fd140463feac06cf1543fcbe566501","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, AC is either equal to AB or less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果不是,AC等于或少于AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef58096b45399e4c149bbf58c9037894a7baf92ddd13860a06f1ef7eb7d062bd","citations":["euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now AC is not equal to AB; for then the angle ABC would also have been equal to the angle ACB; [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] but it is not; therefore AC is not equal to AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在AC不等于AB;因为这样,ABC角度也等于ACB角度;但并非如此;因此,AC角度不等于AB。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bbab8708ba3e4d21704ad755416294993462b5e027397d6638c84b3698bd31e2","citations":["euclid-1-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Neither is AC less than AB, for then the angle ABC would also have been less than the angle ACB; [[I. 18](/principles/euclid-1-18)] but it is not; therefore AC is not less than AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC比AB也不重要,因为这样,ABC角度也低于ACB角度;但并非如此;因此,AC角度不少于AB。 [[I. 18](/principles/euclid-1-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f6e365486fc3ec4ed3fd1c321415136444824b617943f56b1e3f2324ab51f48","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it was proved that it is not equal either. Therefore AC is greater than AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"事实证明,它也不相等。因此,AC大于AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59ba3c420fad5d0dfbeb63bd05a442b68d4dd6eb20b68d5a123aad07b0277e09","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形大角对大边小角对小边"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每当三角形的大角对应大边，小角对应小边时"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db94cdc61f3e5b7bd40f8d679f104f2b73d47c9ae14ad9d2d87b266b115b94ba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙角形乙角大于丙角题言对乙角之甲丙边必大于对丙角之甲乙边"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙，三角形 乙 大于 丙，命题解释：对于 乙，边 甲丙 必须大于角 丙 的边 甲乙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"466f8cdd560d1f626f02c5d9242178cba5e916bf9904951fc1f93f9c5ecd5e4f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如云不然令言或等或小若言甲丙与甲乙等则甲丙角宜与甲乙角等矣〈本篇五〉何设乙角大于丙角也若言甲丙小于甲乙则甲丙边对甲乙大角宜大〈本篇十八〉又何言小也如甲角大于丙角则乙丙边大于甲乙边依此推显"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：如果不是这样，假设其相等或更小。如果说 甲丙 和 甲乙 相等，那么角 甲丙 应该等于角 甲乙。〈本篇五〉. 为什么让角 乙 大于角 丙？如果说 甲丙 小于 甲乙，那么 甲丙 的大角应大于 甲乙。为什么说它更小？例如，角 甲 大于角 丙，则边 乙丙 大于边 甲乙。由此推断。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-19.source","contentId":"euclid-1-19","revisionId":"euclid-1-19@raw-3b008822cde0a9d7","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1461bb56deec698f9f0ee4b10ad9a18b1cbecf4023a8ccc040301234eaae5554","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.19/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.19\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-19:euclid-1-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-19.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2: